{"text": "DISQUALIFIED PERSONS\n\nAt the upcoming General Election no declaration of candidacy will be accepted\nfrom any of the persons listed below. They are disqualified from being a\ncandidate because they failed to file a complete campaign financial return or\nfiled a campaign financial return late. The disqualification is in effect for 5 years.\n\nRoydon Aggark Arviat December 29, 2013\nElijah Amarook Baker Lake December 29, 2013\nUriah Amaruq Baker Lake December 29, 2013\nLavinia Brown Rankin Inlet December 29, 2013\nDonald Havioyak Kugluktuk December 29, 2013\nLouie Kamookak Gjoa Haven December 29, 2013\nSheila Kamookak Gjoa Haven December 29, 2013\nPeter Kattuk Sanikiluaq December 29, 2013\nJoanne Klengenberg Kugluktuk December 29, 2013\nJohnny Manning Sanikiluaq December 29, 2013\nNapatchie McRae Iqaluit December 29, 2013\nSheila Napayok Arviat December 29, 2013\nMike Patterk Chesterfield Inlet December 29, 2013\nKakki Peter Iqaluit December 29, 2013\nJacopoosie Peter Iqaluit December 29, 2013\nJoanna Quassa Igloolik December 29, 2013\nJoe Sageaktok Iqaluit December 29, 2013\nHarry Tootoo Chesterfield Inlet December 29, 2013\nCelistino Uyarak Igloolik December 29, 2013\nSherry Morey Rankin Inlet December 29, 2013\nZeke Ejetsiak Cape Dorset January 5, 2014\nJosie Sharkey Cape Dorset January 5, 2014\nMarie Kringuk Repulse Bay February 13, 2014\nElisiusie Alakannuark Kugaaruk May 1, 2014\nOvide Alakannuark Kugaaruk May 1, 2014\nJoseph Aglukkaq Gjoa Haven June 25, 2015\nSandra Ruben Gjoa Haven June 25, 2015",
